---
// Hero.astro - Primer Viewport / Tesis de Conversión Clara para PyMEs (Modo Claro + Modo Oscuro Impeccable)
---

<section id="servicios" class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 pt-8 pb-14 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-28 transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#080d1a] dark:text-[#f8fafc]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: The Commercial Value Proposition (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-5 sm:space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Trust & Origin Strip -->
        <div data-hero-badge class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 rounded border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 sm:px-3.5 py-1.5 sm:py-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono-tech text-slate-700 shadow-xs transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#0b1320] dark:text-[#94a3b8] dark:shadow-none">
          <span class="rounded bg-blue-700 px-2 py-0.5 font-bold text-white dark:bg-[#1d4ed8]">INICIATIVA CUCEA</span>
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold dark:text-[#f8fafc]">DESARROLLO WEB & SOFTWARE PARA PYMES</span>
          <span class="text-slate-300 dark:text-[#475569]">|</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold dark:text-[#10b981]">ENTREGA EN 5 DÍAS</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero Headline in Chivo Black (AIDA/PAS Outcome Formula) -->
        <div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
          <h1 id="hero-title" class="text-2xl xs:text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 leading-[1.1] uppercase font-display dark:text-white">
            Tu negocio en internet con calidad de gran empresa. <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
            <span class="text-blue-700 font-black dark:text-[#93c5fd]">
              En 5 días y a precio accesible para tu PyME.
            </span>
          </h1>
          <p data-hero-desc class="max-w-2xl text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
            Hacemos que tu PyME en Guadalajara deje de verse informal y empiece a captar clientes en Google y WhatsApp. Páginas web ultra-rápidas, catálogos digitales y cotizadores automáticos sin cotizaciones infladas ni meses de espera.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- The 3 Core Commercial Pillars -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 sm:gap-4 pt-1 sm:pt-2 text-xs font-mono-tech">
          <div data-hero-pillar class="rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 shadow-xs transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#0c1424] dark:shadow-none">
            <div class="text-amber-700 font-bold mb-1 text-xs dark:text-[#d97706]">01 / PRECIOS FIJOS</div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-normal dark:text-[#94a3b8]">Paquetes cerrados desde $7,500 MXN. Sabes exactamente qué incluye y cuánto pagas.</p>
          </div>
          <div data-hero-pillar class="rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 shadow-xs transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#0c1424] dark:shadow-none">
            <div class="text-emerald-700 font-bold mb-1 text-xs dark:text-[#10b981]">02 / ENTREGA EN 5 DÍAS</div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-normal dark:text-[#94a3b8]">Tu sitio funcionando en días, no en los 2 meses que tardan las agencias tradicionales.</p>
          </div>
          <div data-hero-pillar class="rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 shadow-xs transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#0c1424] dark:shadow-none">
            <div class="text-blue-700 font-bold mb-1 text-xs dark:text-[#3b82f6]">03 / SEDE EN CUCEA</div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-normal dark:text-[#94a3b8]">Reunión presencial en Torre Smart Campus (Piso 2) o videollamada con los fundadores.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Interactive CTAs with High Intent Verbs -->
        <div data-hero-ctas class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 pt-2 sm:pt-4">
          <a 
            href="#diagnostico" 
            data-magnetic-btn
            class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-blue-700 bg-blue-700 px-5 sm:px-7 py-3.5 sm:py-4 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono-tech font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-700/20 transition-all hover:bg-blue-800 active:scale-95 text-center dark:border-[#2563eb] dark:bg-[#1d4ed8] dark:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(29,78,216,0.35)] dark:hover:bg-[#2563eb]"
          >
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
              <span>SOLICITAR DIAGNÓSTICO DIGITAL $0 // 15 MIN</span>
              <span class="magnetic-icon transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">➔</span>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a 
            href="#paquetes" 
            data-magnetic-btn
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-slate-300 bg-white px-5 sm:px-6 py-3.5 sm:py-4 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono-tech text-slate-800 shadow-xs hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all text-center dark:border-[#334155] dark:bg-[#0b1320] dark:text-[#cbd5e1] dark:hover:border-[#64748b] dark:hover:text-white dark:hover:bg-[#111c2e]"
          >
            VER PAQUETES Y PRECIOS
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Trust Note with Real Urgency -->
        <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono-tech text-slate-600 flex items-center gap-2 dark:text-[#64748b]">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-[#10b981] shrink-0"></span>
          <span>Cupo limitado: 4 diagnósticos gratuitos por semana en campus CUCEA o por Google Meet.</span>
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: The Service Guarantee Card (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div id="hero-guarantee-card" data-tilt-card class="relative rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-2 dark:border-[#334155] dark:bg-[#090e1a] dark:shadow-2xl">
          
          <!-- Document Corner Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-4 font-mono-tech dark:border-[#1e293b]">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-[#64748b]">INICIATIVA UNIVERSITARIA</span>
              <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950 uppercase dark:text-white">Ficha de Garantía de Servicio</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded border border-emerald-600/30 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:border-[#10b981]/40 dark:bg-[#10b981]/10 dark:text-[#10b981]">
              RESPALDO UDEG
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Document Fields Grid -->
          <div class="space-y-4 py-4 text-xs font-mono-tech">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 dark:border-[#1e293b]/60">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block dark:text-[#64748b]">EQUIPO DESARROLLADOR:</span>
                <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-[#f8fafc]">KESSOKU DEV // CUCEA</span>
              </div>
              <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 dark:border-[#1e293b]/60">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block dark:text-[#64748b]">SEDE FÍSICA:</span>
                <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-[#cbd5e1]">TORRE SMART (PISO 2)</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 dark:border-[#1e293b]/60">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block dark:text-[#64748b]">TIEMPO DE CARGA MÓVIL:</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-blue-700 dark:text-[#93c5fd]">&lt; 1.0 SEGUNDO (60 FPS)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 dark:border-[#1e293b]/60">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block dark:text-[#64748b]">SOPORTE POST-ENTREGA:</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-[#10b981]">MENSUAL CONTINUO</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-3.5 space-y-1.5 transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#060a12]">
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-800 uppercase font-bold block dark:text-[#94a3b8]">COMPROMISO CON LA COMUNIDAD PYME:</span>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
                "Las consultoras de Guadalajara cobran de $80,000 a $250,000 MXN con meses de burocracia. Kessoku Dev fue creada para que cualquier PyME acceda a tecnología de punta con costo justo y entrega en 5 días."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Official Stamp (Trust Element) -->
          <div class="mt-2 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between dark:border-[#1e293b]">
            <!-- Stamp Box with slight rotation -->
            <div class="transform -rotate-2 rounded border-2 border-dashed border-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-2.5 text-center font-mono-tech dark:border-[#d97706] dark:bg-[#d97706]/10">
              <div class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-amber-700 dark:text-[#d97706]">SERVICIO VERIFICADO</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">CUCEA STARTUP LAB</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-amber-700 font-semibold dark:text-[#f59e0b]">FOLIO: #2026-KD-004</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Founder Signatures Micro-strip -->
            <div class="text-right text-xs font-mono-tech text-slate-500 dark:text-[#64748b]">
              <div>DUPLA FUNDADORES:</div>
              <div class="text-slate-900 font-semibold dark:text-[#cbd5e1]">LTIN (DEV) + LINI (NEGOCIOS)</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-emerald-700 font-bold dark:text-[#10b981]">ESTUDIANTES ACTIVOS CUCEA</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
